    <li><a href="#auto-index">Indexes created by the queries that need them</a></li>
    <li><a href="#defaults">A fresh node starts closed</a></li>
    <li><a href="#tls">HTTPS and rate limiting in the server</a></li>
    <li><a href="#queue">The job and cron queue moves to Soli</a></li>
